<title>LATVIA: EARLY AFTERNOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 7.</title>
<headline>EARLY AFTERNOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 7.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Latvian state radio in the early afternoon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Parliament is due to vote on confirming the government of Guntar Krasts in office.</p>
<p>- Latvian banks protest against the freezing of correspondent accounts by the St Petersburg tax police.</p>
<p>- An oil spill was cleaned up at Ventspils terminal.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
